---
title: "Journal for one set of client bytes"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: free
    lg1: open
    lg2: settled
    lg3: down
    lg4: Breaks NoOrphanedOpenRow or RefusedSendStaysFree
    lg5: Path to the NoOrphanedOpenRow or RefusedSendStaysFree bug
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 yellow
  class lg2 teal
  class lg3 tan
  class lg4 breaks
  class lg5 bugPath
  s0: Not filed yet
  s1: Submission id reserved, not sent
  s2: IRS refused it, saving
  s3: Gave up before sending, bytes free to resend
  s4: Server down, a send open
  s5: IRS has or may have it, saving
  s6: Stuck open: IRS has it, journal write failed
  s7: Stuck open: IRS refused it, journal write failed
  s8: Unknown whether IRS has it
  s9: IRS refused it, bytes free to resend
  s10: Transmitted, receipt saved
  s11: Marked unknown, though IRS refused it
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s0: a request finds the bytes unfiled
  s0 --> s1: a request reserves a submission id
  s1 --> s2: the IRS returns a SOAP fault
  s1 --> s3: the session lock, login, or composition fails
  s1 --> s4: the server crashes
  s1 --> s5: the IRS returns a receipt or the call ends with no clear answer
  s2 --> s7: the journal write fails
  s2 --> s9: the journal saves the fault
  s2 --> s4: the server crashes
  s4 --> s8: the server restarts
  s5 --> s6: the journal write fails
  s5 --> s10: the journal saves the receipt
  s5 --> s4: the server crashes
  s5 --> s8: the journal saves "unknown"
  s3 --> s1: a request reserves a submission id
  s6 --> s4: the server crashes
  s7 --> s4: the server crashes
  s4 --> s11: the server restarts
  s9 --> s1: a request reserves a submission id
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 blue
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 yellow
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 yellow
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 blue
  class s4 tan
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 yellow
  class s5 bugPath
  class s6 yellow
  class s6 breaks
  class s6 bugPath
  class s7 yellow
  class s7 breaks
  class s8 teal
  class s9 blue
  class s10 teal
  class s11 teal
  class s11 breaks
  class s11 bugPath
